{"id":"76e7fe5e5759a867","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-hilbert-bernays.md","title":"Hilbert–Bernays Compatibility Interface","display":"df-hilbert-bernays — Hilbert–Bernays Compatibility Interface","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-hilbert-bernays","aliases":["90-df-hilbert-bernays"],"display":"df-hilbert-bernays — Hilbert–Bernays Compatibility Interface","depends_on":["[[90-df-hbl-conditions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-hilbert-bernays"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-hilbert-bernays</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hilbert-bernays — Hilbert–Bernays Compatibility Interface"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a> 中同一个算术扩张签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、句子理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>、有效编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 和变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\)</span>，数码、替换和可证关系均沿用该环境。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_P\\sigma=P[\\overline{g(\\sigma)}/v]\">\\(\\Box_P\\sigma=P[\\overline{g(\\sigma)}/v]\\)</span> 已在所引文件定义。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)\\)</span> 保留第二不完备性文件原二元调用的三个模式解释，不凭名称推断额外条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a> 的三个可导出性模式谓词，理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 固定，公式参数为同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nP\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ (T\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash\\Box_P\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\Box_P(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P\\tau)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P(\\Box_P\\sigma)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nP\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ (T\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash\\Box_P\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\Box_P(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P\\tau)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P(\\Box_P\\sigma)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 此内容由原第二不完备性文件已明确写出的 HB(T,P) 与 HBL_T(P) 等价式确定，不推断原第 89 本还提供其它结论。三条条件必须用于同一个 P，不能仅由 Prf 的逐数表示性推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-hbl-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8d9c15743f7342d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-hbl-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-hbl-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8d9c15743f7342d2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[90-df-hbl-conditions]] 中同一个算术扩张签名 $S$、句子理论 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$、有效编码 $g$ 和变量 $v$。$P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]$，数码、替换和可证关系均沿用该环境。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-hbl-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8d9c15743f7342d2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)$ 使用 [[90-df-hbl-conditions]] 的三个可导出性模式谓词，理论 $T$ 固定，公式参数为同一 $P$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_P\\sigma=P[\\overline{g(\\sigma)}/v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nP\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ (T\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash\\Box_P\\sigma)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\Box_P(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P\\tau)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P(\\Box_P\\sigma)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1839,"backlinks":[{"id":"7145c12676268ab1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)$ 取本地补齐的 [[90-df-hilbert-bernays]]，保留原二元调用；$P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]$ 与 [[90-df-hbl-conditions]] 固定同一 $S,g,T,v$。下式重述其与三个 HBL 模式的接口等价，不假定有效公理化自动给出这些模式。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[90-df-hilbert-bernays]]"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]、[[90-df-relation]]、[[90-df-hilbert-bernays]] 已给出本地正文。三项同名冲突分别使用 base-formula、base-free-variable、base-godel-numbering 新文件，不覆盖原90文件。补充内容是依据使用语境形成的本地接口，并非未提供外部原文的复原；非标准但良定义的原90接口仍予保留。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["8d9c15743f7342d2"]}